---
import MizuLayout from '@/layouts/MizuLayout.astro'
---

<MizuLayout
  title="Careers | Pixelated Empathy"
  description="Current hiring posture and future roles at Pixelated Empathy."
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden pb-20 pt-32 lg:pb-28 lg:pt-40">
    <div class="site-shell site-shell--narrow relative z-10">
      <div class="mb-16 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-white mb-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-6xl">
          Careers
        </h1>
        <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground md:text-xl">
          Pixelated Empathy is not running a broad hiring push right now. The
          company is still founder-led, and future roles will be added only
          where they directly improve the product and training workflow.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-16 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="bg-white/5 border-white/10 rounded-2xl border p-8 backdrop-blur-sm">
          <h2 class="text-white mb-3 text-xl font-bold">Clinical guidance</h2>
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            Future collaborators should strengthen scenario quality, supervision
            workflows, and feedback language.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/5 border-white/10 rounded-2xl border p-8 backdrop-blur-sm">
          <h2 class="text-white mb-3 text-xl font-bold">Product design</h2>
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            The product needs designers who can make sensitive, complicated
            workflows feel clear and usable.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/5 border-white/10 rounded-2xl border p-8 backdrop-blur-sm">
          <h2 class="text-white mb-3 text-xl font-bold">
            Platform engineering
          </h2>
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            Privacy, analytics, and reliable simulation infrastructure are the
            main technical hiring areas when roles open.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white/5 border-white/10 rounded-2xl border p-8 text-center backdrop-blur-sm md:p-12">
        <h2 class="text-white mb-4 text-3xl font-bold">No open roles today</h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          If your background is unusually relevant to therapist training,
          privacy-aware AI systems, or clinical product design, you can still
          reach out. We would rather have a precise conversation than post a
          generic role description too early.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-500 text-white shadow-primary-500/25 hover:shadow-primary-500/40 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl px-8 py-4 font-bold shadow-lg transition-all hover:-translate-y-1"
        >
          Start a conversation
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MizuLayout>
